{"id": "t154-001", "text": "Delroy - off to Jamaica 14 May, 3 wks, first time back in 10 yrs. going for his gran's 95th, whole family flying in from Toronto + Birmingham. he's worried she's frail, had a fall at Easter. Delroy's partner Ann can't go, work. remind me to ask how his gran is when he's back + get the rum recipe lol", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Delroy", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Jamaica", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 wks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in 10 yrs"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "95th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "frail", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Easter", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Delroy", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how his gran is", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "when he's back", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get the rum recipe", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t154-002", "text": "Ann's mum in hosp again w/ chest infection - 2nd time since Aug. on IV antibiotics, docs say maybe home Mon if bloods ok. Ann v tired, doing nights there + working days, her brother Reggie useless, lives in Glasgow and hasn't been down once. she cried a bit on the phone. check in Fri, offer to cover the school pickup Thurs", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hosp", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chest infection", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since Aug"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Mon", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reggie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Glasgow", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fri", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to cover the school pickup", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thurs", "anchor": "a2"}]}
