{"id": "t154-016", "text": "Emily back from Japan last wk - jet lag awful, still waking at 4am. 2 wks: Tokyo, Kyoto, Hiroshima, then Osaka for the last few days. loved Kyoto most, stayed in a ryokan, said the food was unreal. her bf Julien got food poisoning in Osaka tho, lost 2 days. they want to go back for cherry blossom, maybe April after next", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Japan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last wk", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "4am"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 wks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the last few days", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Kyoto", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bf", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "food poisoning", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 days", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "go back for cherry blossom", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe April after next", "anchor": "e3"}]}
