{"id": "t154-039", "text": "Farid quit cricket club, said his back can't take it anymore - slipped disc diagnosed in summer. physio twice a wk now, Tues + Fri. gutted bc he's been there 15 yrs, was captain of the 2nds. says he'll still do teas + scoring. his wife Aditi relieved tbh. club dinner 29 Nov, they're giving him a send off", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quit cricket club", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slipped disc", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in summer"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tues", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fri", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 yrs"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "club dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "29 Nov", "anchor": "e3"}]}
