{"id": "t154-054", "text": "Shreya - learning ukulele, practises every night, neighbours not thrilled. recital @ the community centre 15/12, first time playing in front of people, v nervous. must text her good luck that morning. her teacher Lukas also playing", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shreya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ukulele", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "neighbours", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not thrilled", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recital @ the community centre", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "15/12", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "teacher", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lukas", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t154-055", "text": "called Eamon - his son Connor broke his collarbone @ rugby Sat. surgery maybe Wed, waiting on the consultant. Eamon blaming himself bc he pushed him to join. Connor gutted, season over. their holiday to Spain next month prob off too. should send Connor a card + maybe some games for the Switch, he's into Zelda", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eamon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke his collarbone", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe Wed", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eamon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "blaming himself", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "holiday to Spain", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Connor a card + maybe some games for the Switch", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Zelda", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t154-056", "text": "Sofia Barros - travel nurse, just back from 6 months in Dubai. starts at Leeds General 1st Nov. says Dubai summer was unbearable, 47 degrees. wants to do NZ next. remind me to ask how first wk goes", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia Barros", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "travel nurse", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 months"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts at Leeds General", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "1st Nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to do NZ next", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how first wk goes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "first wk", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t154-057", "text": "Yetunde's mum flying in from Lagos 20 Dec for Christmas, staying til mid Jan. Yetunde's dad not well enough to travel this time, heart thing. Yetunde a bit low about it. need to ask her round for dinner one evening while her mum's here", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Lagos", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "20 Dec", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "til mid Jan", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "heart thing", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit low", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her round for dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "one evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "while her mum's here", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t154-058", "text": "long chat w/ Abigail - Tobi's moving to Toronto for work 4th Jan, she's not going yet, visa stuff. long distance for 6 months at least. she's putting a brave face on it but v anxious. their dog Pepper staying w/ her. her parents think she shd just go. don't forget to check in after he leaves", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tobi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Toronto", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4th Jan", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "long distance", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 months at least"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting a brave face on it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after he leaves", "anchor": "a1"}]}
